e=\"73-df-space-complexity-notation\">73-df-space-complexity-notation</a>，补集全集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2^*\">\\(\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.6}\\vdash\nS\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le S(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)=\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NSPACE}(S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.6}\\vdash\nS\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le S(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)=\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NSPACE}(S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应 1979 年原书的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>来源更正：本结果发表于 1988 年，作为后续补充保留，不属于 1979 年本书。出版方陈述见 <a href=\"https://epubs.siam.org/doi/10.1137/0217058\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Immerman 原论文</a>；本次核对了发表信息与定理摘要，未逐行核验原论文证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-space-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-space-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-work-space-complementation","status":"resolved","id":"b97e57a60826afa3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-work-space-complementation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-space-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\mathrm{SpaceConstr},\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NSPACE}$ 见 [[73-df-space-complexity-notation]]，补集全集为 $\\mathbf2^*$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SpaceConstr},\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.6}\\vdash\nS\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le S(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)=\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NSPACE}(S)","display":true}],"bytes":2300,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-395","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-nondeterministic-space-complementation|nondeterministic space complementation]]"}],"outgoing":["8346a921772e7ddf","b97e57a60826afa3"]}